--- Initialize a semaphore with the supplied nonnegative count.
-- @param owner Mutable fresh final sem_t() storage; explicit destroy/delete after native users retire.
-- @param value Input integer value; checked native narrowing occurs before native ownership is accepted.
-- @return Native operation result or submission status; negative values report libuv errors.
-- @usage uv/functions/threading.md#sem_init
function sem_init(owner: sem_t, value: integer): integer
    return owner:init(value)
